    "extract": "The 24th Multi-member Constituency is one of Bulgaria's 31 electoral districts. It comprises several districts in eastern and central Sofia, including Sredets, Oborishte, Vazrazhdane, Iskar, Kremikovtsi, Poduyane, Serdika, and Slatina.",
    "extract_html": "<p>The <b>24th Multi-member Constituency</b> is one of Bulgaria's 31 electoral districts. It comprises several districts in eastern and central Sofia, including Sredets, Oborishte, Vazrazhdane, Iskar, Kremikovtsi, Poduyane, Serdika, and Slatina.</p>"
